// Hello AI — the simplest possible GX AI agent
//
// Run:
//   gx run docs/examples/hello_ai.gx
//
// This is Level 1 (Pure Intent) syntax.
// No braces. No brain cycle. No boilerplate.
// Just: who you are, what you know, what you do.

Agent Greeter

name    = "World"
topic   = "the universe"

"Hello {name}! I'm your AI guide to {topic}."
""

question  = input("What do you want to know about {topic}? ")
ai_result = ask openai { prompt: "Tell me something fascinating about " + topic + ". The user asked: " + question, model: "gpt-4o-mini" }

"Here's what I found:"
print(ai_result["text"])
